-- LAYER-1 TESTS: the instruments and the vintages, both sides of every date edge found.
-- Expected values are written by hand from the amending instruments' own commencement clauses and text
-- (each rule's @ref gives the raw line).  They say what each provision says on each date and name no person's situation.
-- "NOTHING" is the assertion that the deposited text does not speak for the date.

§ `Test equipment`

`a walkie-talkie` MEANS `A piece of equipment` OF "a hand-held walkie-talkie", (LIST `transmission`, `reception`), (LIST `Hertzian or radio waves`)
`a wired telephone` MEANS `A piece of equipment` OF "a wired telephone", (LIST `transmission`, `reception`), (LIST `wire`)
`a GPS receiver` MEANS `A piece of equipment` OF "a GPS receiver", (LIST `reception`), (LIST `Hertzian or radio waves`)

